OL,3,AIran faces 'economic D-Day', US
OL,4,ATreasury Secretary warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Treasury Secretary has threated
OL,7,FIran with "the single greatest
OL,8,Ffinancial offensive ever", claiming the
OL,9,FUS-Israel war with Iran was "entering
OL,10,Fits endgame".
OL,12,FScott Bessent said the US would sever
OL,13,Fall economic ties with the country in
OL,14,F"an economic D-Day" and that any nation
OL,15,Fpartnering with Iran financially would
OL,16,Falso be isolated.
OL,18,FBessent's threat to the Iranian regime
OL,19,Ffollows several U-turns and extended
OL,20,Fdeadlines from US President Donald
OL,21,FTrump's administration on previous
OL,22,Fthreats.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
