OL,3,AIran faces 'economic D-Day', US
OL,4,ATreasury Secretary warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran dismissed Bessent's comments and
OL,7,Fsaid it would shut down all oil exports
OL,8,Ffrom the region "if the war continues",
OL,9,Faccording to news agency Reuters.
